 content="""
FWIW, I did add a note to the git-annex-export man page that git-annex
expects to be the only thing writing to an exporttree=yes remote unless
importtree=yes. So hopefully there will be less confused users. However,
I'm doubtful that will be enough to avoid all confusion.

So, I've also made it display a warning in this situation.
"""]]
